OL,3,GNEWSAI spent a week in prison after my
OL,4,Awrongful arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cleaner who spent a week in jail
OL,7,Fafter being wrongfully accused of
OL,8,Fsparking anti-immigration disorder in
OL,9,FThetford has told the BBC he has "run
OL,10,Fout of tears" over the ordeal, which he
OL,11,Fcompared to a "kangaroo court".
OL,13,FAddresses on five streets were targeted
OL,14,Fby crowds over three nights in August,
OL,15,Fprompting violent scenes which saw
OL,16,Fasylum seekers escorted from houses by
OL,17,FNorfolk Police.
