OL,3,GNEWSAI spent a week in prison after my
OL,4,Awrongful arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Jobson, from Costessey, was
OL,7,Fcharged with misconduct in public
OL,8,Foffice after being accused of sharing
OL,9,Fthe addresses of the properties and
OL,10,Fspent seven days in Norwich Prison,
OL,11,Fbefore the charges were dropped.
OL,13,FThe force said evidence was put to
OL,14,FJobson during police interviews, but he
OL,15,Foffered "no comment" answers.
